WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.860
Welcome to monstr....

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.380
Don't be afraid, it's only monsters

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:11.240
I'm Dr. Emily Zarka. I have a PhD in
literature and a fascination with the

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.820
gothic in horror. I'm a professor but I'm also a huge nerd,

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:19.529
and I'm here to take you on a journey
with Monstrum - the show that takes you

00:00:19.529 --> 00:00:23.880
across the globe and through time, to
look at the monsters and myths that have

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:28.760
shaped who we are. Why did Godzilla
emerge from Japan. Are dragons real?

00:00:28.769 --> 00:00:34.160
What exactly is a Kraken? Monstrum looks at humans unique drive to create and shape

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:39.570
monster mythology through oral
storytelling, literature, and film. Monster

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:42.780
history is human history.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:49.580
Welcome to Monstrum.

